  "html": "<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:162px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/TipperGourd.jpg\" title=\"Tipper Gourd\"><img alt=\"Tipper Gourd\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"324\" src=\"/images/TipperGourd.jpg\" width=\"160\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/TipperGourd.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>Tipper Gourd</div></div></div>\n<p>Tipper Gourd is a female NPC that can be found in the <a href=\"/wiki/The_Mutanous_Malaise_Mezzanine\" title=\"The Mutanous Malaise Mezzanine\">The Mutanous Malaise Mezzanine</a>. She is the self-proclaimed \"Madam President for Life\" of the <a class=\"missing\" href=\"/wiki/Citizen_Action_Committee\" title=\"Citizen Action Committee\">Citizen Action Committee</a>. She gives various quests involving the removal of monsters in the record business and keeping their records out of the hands of youngsters like <a href=\"/wiki/Dorcas\" title=\"Dorcas\">Dorcas</a> of <a href=\"/wiki/Townston\" title=\"Townston\">Townston</a>, as well as some other errands.\n</p><p>She gives quests including:\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Incendiary_Record_Artists\" title=\"Incendiary Record Artists\">Incendiary Record Artists</a>\n</li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Original_Fangstah_Record_Artists\" title=\"Original Fangstah Record Artists\">Original Fangstah Record Artists</a>\n</li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Monster_Mosh\" title=\"Monster Mosh\">Monster Mosh</a>\n</li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Monsters_Moshing\" title=\"Monsters Moshing\">Monsters Moshing</a>\n</li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Sitar_Hero_-_Face_Off\" title=\"Sitar Hero - Face Off\">Sitar Hero - Face Off</a>\n</li></ul>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
}
